    "text": "nflfixtures.com\nwebsite\nFort Myers\nNeumann vs Bishop Verot | Florida High School Football | August 15\n1 days ago\nThe upcoming high school football season in Florida kicks off with an intriguing non-conference matchup between the Neumann Celtics and the Bishop Verot Vikings. Set for Friday, August 15, 2025, at 7:00 p.m., this contest will be played at Bishop Verot High School in Fort Myers, Florida. Fans unable to attend the game live can watch it streamed on the NFHS Network, offering broad access to this promising early-season showdown.\n2",
